---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import InsightBox from './InsightBox.astro';
import { Briefcase, DollarSign, Server } from 'lucide-react';
---

{/* New Section: Active Trader Program */}
<Section
  id="active-trader"
  title="The 'Hidden' Tier: Active Trader Program"
  icon={Briefcase}
>
  <p class="leading-relaxed mb-6">
    Most retail traders never scroll far enough to find this, but it's arguably
    the most potent "bonus" Pepperstone offers. It's called the <strong
      >Active Trader Program</strong
    >.
  </p>
  <p class="leading-relaxed mb-6">
    While they don't offer sign-up bonuses, they <em>do</em> pay you to trade if
    you have volume. This is how the professionals operate. Instead of a one-time
    carrot, you get a continuous revenue stream.
  </p>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <DollarSign
          className="text-emerald-600"
          size={24}
        />
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800">The Rebate Engine</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
        Pepperstone pays rebates back into your account{' '}
        <strong>daily</strong>. This is a massive differentiator; most brokers
        make you wait until the end of the month.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-800">
        <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-1">
          <span>Tier 1 (Up to 200 lots)</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900"> $1.00 / lot </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-1">
          <span>Tier 2 (200 - 1500 lots)</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900"> $2.00 / lot </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex justify-between">
          <span>Tier 3 (1500+ lots)</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900"> $3.00 / lot </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <Server
          className="text-blue-600"
          size={24}
        />
        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800">The Kenya-Specific Edge</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
        For us in Kenya, the real gem isn't just the money—it's the{' '}
        <strong>Free VPS Hosting</strong> included in the program.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
        We all know Nairobi power/internet can be unpredictable. A VPS keeps
        your Expert Advisors (EAs) running 24/7 on a server next to the
        exchange, reducing latency and ensuring you never miss a trade due to a
        local blackout.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <InsightBox
    title="The Mentor's Warning: The 'Churn' Trap"
    type="warning"
  >
    <p class="mb-2">
      This program is powerful, but it comes with a danger:{' '}
      <strong>Overtrading</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      I have seen traders force bad setups just to hit the "200 lots" tier for a
      higher rebate. <strong>Do not do this.</strong> Never trade <em>for</em> the
      rebate. Treat the rebate as a passive "dividend" on your normal, disciplined
      trading. If you lose $500 on a forced trade to earn a $2 rebate, you have lost
      the game.
    </p>
  </InsightBox>

  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 italic">
    *Note: Entry into the program usually requires contacting support or hitting
    volume thresholds over a 3-month period. Contact{' '}
    <span class="font-mono bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded">
      premium@pepperstone.com
    </span>{' '}
    if you are a high-volume trader.
  </p>
</Section>
